// VSCO 2 CE harp: concert harp, plucked. Samples: Versilian Studios Chamber Orchestra 2 Community Edition (VSCO-2-CE), CC0 1.0 (https://github.com/sgossner/VSCO-2-CE, commit 440300901dfe).
// Generated by scripts/make_vsco2_library.py; sample paths are relative to the repository root.
